# Agent: 1C Fresh Delivery Gate

Use when user mentions **Фреш / 1cfresh / облако / модель сервиса / публикация в сервис**, or delivery is CFE/EPF/ERF for cloud/web (not local thin-client only).

Also load Hub lesson `fresh-delivery-gate` (path `playbooks/agent-lessons/fresh/fresh-delivery-gate.md`). Reply `KB: fresh-delivery-gate, …`.

